  "name": "Shadows over Millbrook",
  "status": "active",
  "data": {
    "startLocationId": "loc_tankard"
  },
  "description": "A quiet mining town at the edge of the Thornwood. Caravans vanish on the Ember Road, the old quarry has gone silent, and someone in town is lying about why.",
  "locations": [
    {
      "id": "loc_valley",
      "name": "The Ember Vale",
      "type": "Region",
      "parentId": "",
      "visible": true,
      "data": {
        "readAloud": "Low hills of red stone, pine forest to the north, and a single road winding through it all.",
        "notes": "",
        "tags": []
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "loc_millbrook",
      "name": "Millbrook",
      "type": "Settlement",
      "parentId": "loc_valley",
      "visible": false,
      "data": {
        "readAloud": "A few dozen timber houses around a market square; smoke rises from the smithy, and the bell of a small chapel rings the hour.",
        "notes": "Population ~300. The town council meets at the inn.",
        "tags": [
          "chapter 1"
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "loc_tankard",
      "name": "The Gilded Tankard",
      "type": "Building",
      "parentId": "loc_millbrook",
      "visible": true,
      "data": {
        "readAloud": "Warm light, the smell of roast and pipe smoke, and a bard who knows exactly three songs.",
        "notes": "Rooms 5 sp a night. Hilda hears every rumour.",
        "tags": []
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "loc_tankard_cellar",
      "name": "Tankard Cellar",
      "type": "Room",
      "parentId": "loc_tankard",
      "visible": false,
      "data": {
        "readAloud": "",
        "notes": "A loose flagstone hides a tunnel to the old drainage — Vesk's men use it to move stolen goods.",
        "tags": [
          "secret"
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "loc_chapel",
      "name": "Chapel of the Dawn",
      "type": "Building",
      "parentId": "loc_millbrook",
      "visible": true,
      "data": {
        "readAloud": "Whitewashed walls, a sunburst window and a garden of healing herbs.",
        "notes": "",
        "tags": []
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "loc_road",
      "name": "The Ember Road",
      "type": "Wilderness",
      "parentId": "loc_valley",
      "visible": false,
      "data": {
        "readAloud": "Rutted cart tracks between red boulders; broken wagons lie in the ditches.",
        "notes": "Wolves hunt here at dusk.",
        "tags": [
          "chapter 1"
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "loc_quarry",
      "name": "The Old Quarry",
      "type": "Dungeon",
      "parentId": "loc_valley",
      "visible": false,
      "data": {
        "readAloud": "",
        "notes": "Abandoned after a collapse 10 years ago. Bandits camp in the upper pit; the lower galleries lead to the cult's shrine.",
        "tags": [
          "chapter 2"
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "loc_shrine",
      "name": "Shrine of the Hollow Flame",
      "type": "Room",
      "parentId": "loc_quarry",
      "visible": false,
      "data": {
        "readAloud": "",
        "notes": "Corvane's cultists keep a black candle burning here. The ritual completes at the next new moon.",
        "tags": [
          "chapter 3",
          "secret"
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "loc_thornwood",
      "name": "The Thornwood",
      "type": "Wilderness",
      "parentId": "loc_valley",
      "visible": false,
      "data": {
        "readAloud": "Twisted trees close in overhead; thorns catch at cloaks and skin.",
        "notes": "Grizzletooth's goblins lair in a hollow under a fallen oak.",
        "tags": []
      }
    }
  ],
